C4 (hypothesis): the MySQL option-file parser strips the quotes around a
value, so password="e2e-password" in [client] is the password e2e-password
and the connection works. mydumper itself never reads [client] (compare
mdl313-quoted-outputdir-keeps-quotes, where mydumper keeps the quotes).
-- scenario --
tool: mydumper
versions: >= v0.19.1-1
args: --defaults-file /work/defaults.cnf --database app
lint: MDL405
expect config-loaded: true
expect exit: 0
expect connected: true
-- defaults.cnf --
[client]
host=mysql
user=e2e
password="e2e-password"

[mydumper]
threads=2
